  title: Overweight Extract
  description: 'I think you need to feel what it''s like to be a little greedy demon.
    Make yourself overweight on purpose by shoving everything you can find into your
    inventory then extract from the raid. You''ll see how much of a challenge being
    slowed down is. Hopefully it''ll teach you not to die from your own greed.

'
